00:02:52.306 --> 00:02:57.211 size:53% position:73% line:53%
"Mais ce n'était pas une

00:02:53.841 --> 00:02:57.211 size:53% position:73% line:53%
option", nourererererereresse

00:02:55.342 --> 00:02:57.211 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de l'époque.

00:03:04.518 --> 00:03:08.989 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Mais les panneaux solaires font

00:03:06.020 --> 00:03:10.524 size:53% position:73% line:53%
u u u u u u u u paysage

00:03:07.588 --> 00:03:13.293 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à Block Island, comme ici,

00:03:09.089 --> 00:03:14.528 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à l'hôtel de ville.

00:03:10.624 --> 00:03:15.729 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Rosemarie Ives craintc c c c c ,

00:03:13.393 --> 00:03:20.400 size:53% position:73% line:53%
son bel horizon se transforme

00:03:14.628 --> 00:03:21.602 size:53% position:73% line:53%
