00:03:15.829 --> 00:03:22.803 size:53% position:73% line:53%
industrielle.

00:03:20.501 --> 00:03:28.342 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Car Block Island sert un peu

00:03:21.702 --> 00:03:29.543 size:53% position:73% line:53%
