00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:51.892 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de voiture.C'C'C'C'C'C'C'C'C'C'e

00:04:49.523 --> 00:04:53.093 size:53% position:73% line:53%
voiture aux États-Unis, dit-il,

00:04:50.758 --> 00:04:57.598 size:53% position:73% line:53%
