00:04:53.193 --> 00:05:01.268 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des éoliennes en mer."

00:04:57.698 --> 00:05:02.503 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 L'impact du réchauffement

00:04:58.899 --> 00:05:06.640 size:53% position:73% line:53%
climatique se fait beaucoup L L,

00:05:01.368 --> 00:05:06.640 size:53% position:73% line:53%
comme beaucoup d'autres,

00:05:02.603 --> 00:05:06.640 size:53% position:73% line:53%
