00:05:20.487 --> 00:05:25.292 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 "La planète va survivre,

00:05:21.688 --> 00:05:28.595 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dit-il, mais peut-être pas nous.

00:05:22.923 --> 00:05:28.595 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Allons-nous l'endommageru'u'u'us

00:05:25.392 --> 00:05:28.595 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les bienvenus?"

00:05:38.639 --> 00:05:45.612 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 "Je suis inquiet, mais j'ai

00:05:39.840 --> 00:05:46.847 size:53% position:73% line:53%
